SUMMARY:Berries & Ivy 2026 Christmas Open House
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
UID:d61a8877022c472e6f380179886e696a@visitmorgancountyin.com
DESCRIPTION:One of Morgan County's most unique shops\, Berries and Ivy is 
 guaranteed to have something just perfect for those on your Christmas list
 . Get a jump on your holiday shopping with their annual Christmas Open Hou
 se\, the first Saturday in November. They literally shut the store down to
  change gears from fall and Halloween to Christmas splendor! Come early - 
 the first several shoppers will receive a free gift!
LOCATION:Berries & Ivy Country Store\, 28 N. Main Street\, Martinsville\, 
 IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/berries-%26-ivy-2026-christm
 as-open-house/11996/
X-SOURCE:Visit Morgan County
END:VEVENT
