 ation will take place on Friday\, November 13\, at Faith Church in Martins
 ville\, beginning at 7 pm. The students of Woodridge Music Academy along w
 ith the Martinsville Community Choir\, will perform a patriotic concert le
 d by special conductor Tim James. All veterans in attendance will receive 
